13
00:00:46,257 --> 00:00:47,917
Stephen Hawking. Stephen Hawking.

14
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:49,855
(Sheldon:)Stephen Hawking.

15
00:00:51,262 --> 00:00:53,422
(Leonard:)Penny started taking a class.
She wrote a paper.

16
00:00:53,597 --> 00:00:56,587
(Leonard:)She didn't want me to read it.
I went behind her back. I read it.

17
00:00:56,801 --> 00:00:59,601
(Sheldon:)Stephen Hawking hates me.

